    "title": "What channel is Purdue-Texas game today? March Madness 2026 Sweet 16 game time, streaming",
    "text": "March 26, 2026, 6:09 a.m. ETThe Purdue Boilermakers will face the Texas Longhorns in a 2026 NCAA men's basketball tournament Sweet 16 game.The game is scheduled for Thursday, March 26, 2026, at 7:10 p.m. ET.Viewers can watch the matchup on CBS or stream it via Fubo.The article also provides the Sweet 16 schedule for the 2026 March Madness tournament.The Purdue Boilermakers play the Texas Longhorns in the Sweet 16 of the NCAA men's basketball tournament in March Madness action tonight on CBS.Here's what you need to know about tonight's matchup, how to watch, the 2026 March Madness bracket, odds, picks and predictions: What channel is Purdue Boilermakers vs Texas Longhorns game on TV today, Thursday, March 26? How to watch Texas-Purdue March Madness 2026 NCAA tournament Sweet 16 game tonight liveThe Purdue Boilermakers and Texas Longhorns will air on CBS Thursday, March 26, 2026.Watch NCAA tournament action on Paramount+ What time is Texas Longhorns vs Purdue Boilermakers game start today, Thursday, March 26? When is Purdue-Texas March Madness 2026 NCAA tournament game tonight liveThe Purdue Boilermakers and Texas Longhorns will play on CBS at 7:10 p.m. ET, Thursday, March 26, 2026.Watch NCAA tournament action on Paramount+ How to stream Purdue-Texas game today, Thursday, March 26. Where to watch Texas-Purdue March Madness 2026 NCAA tournament game tonight liveThe Texas Longhorns and Purdue Boilermakers will stream via Paramount+ and SlingTV at 7:10 pm. ET, Thursday, March 26, 2026. Fans can download Paramount+ in the Apple App Store or on Google Play. Fans can download SlingTV in the Apple App Store or on Google Play.Watch NCAA tournament action with a free Fubo trial2025-2026 Purdue Boilermakers regular season record, Big Ten conference recordPurdue Boilermakers: (29-8, 13-7 Big Ten)2025-2026 Texas Longhorns regular season record, SEC conference recordTexas Longhorns: (21-14, 9-9 SEC)March Madness 2026 NCAA tournament bracket schedule of games tonight: Start time, TV channel, where to watch, stream every men's basketball game2026 NCAA tournament Sweet 16 March Madness games Thursday, March 26(2) Purdue Boilermakers vs. (11) Texas Longhorns, 7:10 p.m. ET, CBS | Preview(4) Nebraska Cornhuskers vs. (9) Iowa Hawkeyes, 7:30 p.m. ET, TBS | Preview(1) Arizona Wildcats vs. (4) Arkansas Razorbacks, 9:45 p.m. ET, CBS | Preview(2) Houston Cougars vs. (3) Illinois Fighting Illini, 10:05 p.m. ET, TBS | PreviewWatch the NCAA Tournament with a Fubo trial2026 NCAA tournament Sweet 16 March Madness games Friday, March 27(1) Duke Blue Devils vs. (5) St. John's Red Storm, 7:10 p.m. ET, CBS | Preview(1) Michigan Wolverines vs. (4) Alabama Crimson Tide, 7:35 p.m. ET, TBS | Preview(2) Connecticut Huskies vs. (3) Michigan State Spartans, 9:45 p.m. ET, CBS | Preview(2) Iowa State Cyclones vs. (6) Tennessee Volunteers, 10:10 p.m. ET, TBS | PreviewWatch the NCAA Tournament on Sling2026 NCAA tournament Sweet 16 round March Madness gamesThursday, March 26, and Friday, March 27.2026 NCAA tournament Elite Eight round March Madness gamesSaturday, March 28, and Sunday, March 29.2026 NCAA tournament Final Four round March Madness games at Lucas Oil Stadium in IndianapolisLucas Oil Stadium in Indianapolis, 6 p.m. and 8:30 p.m. ET, Saturday, April 4, TBS.March Madness 2026 NCAA tournament championship game at Lucas Oil Stadium in IndianapolisLucas Oil Stadium in Indianapolis, 8:30 p.m. ET, Monday, April 6, TBS.Watch the Sweet 16 on Sling2026 NCAA tournament odds for March Madness bracket betting: BetMGMVisit www.in.betmgm.com for the latest odds of every NCAA tournament men's basketball game.2026 March Madness bracket picks, predictions for NCAA tournament men's basketballCompare your March Madness bracket to the USA Today experts. See every pick from 10 different brackets.Nathan Baird and Sam King have the best Purdue sports coverage, and sign up for IndyStar's Boilermakers newsletter.",
